OL,3,CRichard Hughes leaves role as
OL,4,CLiverpool sporting director
OL,6,FLiverpool's sporting director Richard
OL,7,FHughes has stepped down after just
OL,8,Fover two years in the job.
OL,10,FHughes oversaw the appointment and
OL,11,Ffiring of Arne Slot, along with taking
OL,12,Fon his replacement Andoni Iraola
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/7
