OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1788626898
OL,3,CRichard Hughes leaves role as
OL,4,CLiverpool sporting director
OL,6,FHe has long been linked with Saudi
OL,7,FArabian club Al Hilal and oversaw the
OL,8,Flargest spending spree in the club's
OL,9,Fhistory with the #450million spent
OL,10,Flast summer. That included British
OL,11,Frecord transfer Alexander Isak,
OL,12,FFlorian Wirtz and Hugo Ekitike,
OL,13,Fsupplemented by a further #250m in the
OL,14,Fmost recent window.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/7
