OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1788626898
OL,3,CRichard Hughes leaves role as
OL,4,CLiverpool sporting director
OL,6,FThe recent transfers saw the arrivals
OL,7,Fof France international Bradley
OL,8,FBarcola, in a deal potentially rising
OL,9,Fto #123m, defender Jeremy Jacquet,
OL,10,FSpain winger Victor Munoz and
OL,11,Fgoalkeeper Lucca Brughmanns, although
OL,12,Fthe latter will not join until next
OL,13,Fseason.
OL,15,FIt is believed Hughes made his
OL,16,Fdecision earlier this year, following
OL,17,FMichael Edwards' departure as owners
OL,18,FFenway Sports Group's chief executive
OL,19,Fof football, but due to the work he
OL,20,Fhad already undertaken it was agreed
OL,21,Fhe would see out the summer window.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
