OL,3,CRichard Hughes leaves role as
OL,4,CLiverpool sporting director
OL,6,FIt is also understood at no point was
OL,7,Fpermission sought or offered for
OL,8,FHughes to work for any other club
OL,9,Fduring this period and the club are
OL,10,Fentirely satisfied this agreement was
OL,11,Fhonoured.
OL,13,FFenway Sports Group president Mike
OL,14,FGordon, who will lead the process to
OL,15,Ffind a replacement, said:
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
