OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1788626898
OL,3,CRichard Hughes leaves role as
OL,4,CLiverpool sporting director
OL,6,F"Richard joined us at the start of a
OL,7,Fperiod of change, embracing that
OL,8,Fresponsibility by leading our football
OL,9,Foperations department and overseeing
OL,10,Frecruitment while also providing
OL,11,Fvaluable support to our coaching
OL,12,Fstaff."
OL,14,F"The results we achieved in these
OL,15,Fareas during this period are testament
OL,16,Fto this contribution. Nevertheless, we
OL,17,Frespect Richard's life choices and
OL,18,Fwish him and his family well in their
OL,19,Fnext venture."
