OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1788626898
OL,3,CRichard Hughes leaves role as
OL,4,CLiverpool sporting director
OL,6,FOther senior members of Liverpool's
OL,7,Ffootball operations department will
OL,8,Fremain in post
OL,10,FHughes said: "First and foremost, I
OL,11,Fwould like to reiterate what I said
OL,12,Fupon my arrival ` it has been a source
OL,13,Fof great pride to have been given the
OL,14,Fopportunity to serve this incredible
OL,15,Fand unique institution. That is
OL,16,Fsomething I will always be grateful
OL,17,Ffor."
OL,26,@rD@NOU
