OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1788626898
OL,3,CRichard Hughes leaves role as
OL,4,CLiverpool sporting director
OL,6,F"My appreciation extends to the
OL,7,Fownership for their support and
OL,8,Fleadership, to club staff at all
OL,9,Flevels who give so much to make
OL,10,FLiverpool FC what it is, to the
OL,11,Fplayers who make such an enormous
OL,12,Fcontribution and to the fans who
OL,13,Fsupport the team in great numbers
OL,14,Fwhenever and wherever games take
OL,15,Fplace."
OL,17,F"I'll always follow and support the
OL,18,Fclub with great affection, and I wish
OL,19,Feveryone involved nothing but success
OL,20,Ffor this season and beyond."
